---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout>
	<div class="terms-container">
		<div class="terms-content">
			<h1>Terms and Conditions</h1>

			<div class="last-updated">
				Last updated: June 2025
			</div>

			<div class="intro">
				<p>
					Welcome to LinguaLoop, a mobile application developed by Linguatech ("we", "us", or "our"). These Terms and Conditions ("Terms") govern your use of the LinguaLoop mobile application and associated services (collectively, the "App"). By accessing or using the App, you agree to these Terms. If you do not agree, do not use the App.
				</p>
			</div>

			<div class="terms-section">
				<h2>1. Purpose</h2>
				<p>
					These Terms define the rights and obligations between Linguatech and users ("you") regarding the use of the LinguaLoop language learning app and its services across mobile platforms.
				</p>
			</div>

			<div class="terms-section">
				<h2>2. Definitions</h2>
				<p><strong>App:</strong> The LinguaLoop application and its related services.</p>
				<p><strong>User:</strong> Any person who accesses or uses the App.</p>
				<p><strong>Account:</strong> The profile and credentials used to access the App.</p>
				<p><strong>Content:</strong> All exercises, features, and media provided by the App. This includes embedded YouTube videos, which remain the intellectual property of their respective creators.</p>
				<p><strong>Subscription:</strong> A paid plan that grants access to premium features within the App.</p>
				<p><strong>User Content:</strong> Any data or media submitted by users within the App.</p>
			</div>

			<div class="terms-section">
				<h2>3. Acceptance of Terms</h2>
				<p>
					By using the App, you accept these Terms and our Privacy Policy. If you do not agree, you must discontinue use immediately.
				</p>
			</div>

			<div class="terms-section">
				<h2>4. Interpretation of Terms</h2>
				<p>
					If any conflict arises between these Terms and specific feature or promotion terms, the latter shall prevail. Matters not covered will follow applicable law and standard business practice.
				</p>
			</div>

			<div class="terms-section">
				<h2>5. Account Registration and Use</h2>
				<p>
					To use the App, you are required to create an account. Registration is necessary to access the features and content offered within LinguaLoop. You agree to provide accurate, current, and complete information and to maintain its accuracy. We reserve the right to suspend or terminate your access for violations of these Terms or fraudulent activity.
				</p>
			</div>

			<div class="terms-section">
				<h2>6. Account Security</h2>
				<p>
					You are responsible for keeping your login credentials confidential. If you believe your account has been compromised, notify us at contact@linguatech.app. We are not responsible for losses from unauthorized use unless due to our negligence.
				</p>
			</div>

			<div class="terms-section">
				<h2>7. Service Features</h2>
				<p>LinguaLoop provides:</p>
				<ul>
					<li>Dictation exercises and comprehension quizzes using video content</li>
					<li>Progress tracking and learning recommendations</li>
					<li>Language practice content (currently English and Spanish)</li>
					<li>Access to a limited number of exercises per day for free users; full content access is available to subscribers</li>
				</ul>
				<p>We may modify features or the availability of the App at any time without liability.</p>
			</div>

			<div class="terms-section">
				<h2>8. Service Modifications</h2>
				<p>
					We may update, suspend, or discontinue features for technical, operational, or business reasons. No compensation is owed for such modifications unless otherwise stated.
				</p>
			</div>

			<div class="terms-section">
				<h2>9. Notifications</h2>
				<p>
					We may send you notices via the App, email, or website. You are responsible for keeping your contact information current. We are not liable for missed notices due to outdated information.
				</p>
			</div>

			<div class="terms-section">
				<h2>10. Temporary Interruptions</h2>
				<p>
					We may interrupt access for maintenance or emergencies. When feasible, we will notify you in advance. We are not liable for losses during such downtime.
				</p>
			</div>

			<div class="terms-section">
				<h2>11. Termination by User</h2>
				<p>
					You may stop using the App or request account deletion at any time. Deleting your account will remove all associated data, which cannot be recovered.
				</p>
			</div>

			<div class="terms-section">
				<h2>12. Termination by Linguatech</h2>
				<p>We may suspend or terminate your access without notice if you:</p>
				<ul>
					<li>Violate these Terms or laws</li>
					<li>Use the App fraudulently or abusively</li>
					<li>Interfere with or disrupt the App or other users</li>
				</ul>
			</div>

			<div class="terms-section">
				<h2>13. Advertising and Third-Party Content</h2>
				<p>
					We may display third-party ads. We are not responsible for content or reliability of third-party services accessed via the App. Embedded videos from YouTube are provided under YouTube's terms of use. Linguatech does not claim ownership over any YouTube content featured in the App.
				</p>
			</div>

			<div class="terms-section">
				<h2>14. Our Responsibilities</h2>
				<p>
					We will provide the App in a secure, stable, and reliable manner. We take data protection seriously and follow our Privacy Policy. We may respond to support inquiries or complaints at our discretion.
				</p>
			</div>

			<div class="terms-section">
				<h2>15. User Responsibilities</h2>
				<p>You agree not to:</p>
				<ul>
					<li>Reproduce or distribute App content</li>
					<li>Harass or defame others</li>
					<li>Scrape, reverse-engineer, or use the App via bots</li>
					<li>Submit unlawful, offensive, or infringing content</li>
				</ul>
			</div>

			<div class="terms-section">
				<h2>16. User-Generated Content</h2>
				<p>
					You may create or submit content within the App (e.g., recordings, feedback). You retain ownership but grant us a license to use such content for improvement or promotional purposes. We may moderate or remove content that violates these Terms.
				</p>
			</div>

			<div class="terms-section">
				<h2>17. Intellectual Property</h2>
				<p>
					All App content and branding are owned by Linguatech or its licensors. You may not reuse any part of the App without our written permission. YouTube content is owned by its original creators and is used in compliance with YouTube's API Services Terms.
				</p>
			</div>

			<div class="terms-section">
				<h2>18. Disclaimer and Limitation of Liability</h2>
				<p>
					We provide the App "as is." We do not guarantee uninterrupted service, accuracy, or availability. We are not responsible for losses from downtime, user content, or third-party content.
				</p>
			</div>

			<div class="terms-section">
				<h2>19. Payments</h2>
				<p>
					All payments are processed through the Apple App Store. Prices, renewals, and refunds are governed by Apple's policies. Contact Apple Support for payment-related issues.
				</p>
			</div>

			<div class="terms-section">
				<h2>20. Right of Withdrawal</h2>
				<p>
					Refunds are handled by Apple. You may be eligible for a refund within the period allowed by Apple. LinguaLoop cannot override refund decisions made by Apple.
				</p>
			</div>

			<div class="terms-section">
				<h2>21. Mistaken Payments</h2>
				<p>
					For mistaken or duplicate payments, contact Apple. If Linguatech processes a refund (e.g., for promotional credits), we may deduct applicable transaction fees.
				</p>
			</div>

			<div class="terms-section">
				<h2>22. Damages and Liability</h2>
				<p>
					Each party is responsible for damages caused by breaches of these Terms if intentional or negligent. Our liability is limited to the fullest extent permitted by law.
				</p>
			</div>

			<div class="terms-section">
				<h2>23. Service Termination</h2>
				<p>
					We may shut down the App permanently with 30 days' notice. Features may be restricted during the transition.
				</p>
			</div>

			<div class="terms-section">
				<h2>24. Governing Law and Jurisdiction</h2>
				<p>
					These Terms are governed by the laws of the Republic of Argentina. Any disputes shall be resolved by the courts of Buenos Aires, Argentina.
				</p>
			</div>

			<div class="terms-section">
				<h2>25. Data Protection</h2>
				<p>
					We process personal data in accordance with our <a href="/lingualoop/privacy-policy">Privacy Policy</a>. By using the App, you consent to our handling of your information as described there.
				</p>
			</div>

			<div class="contact-section">
				<h2>Contact Us</h2>
				<p>For any questions, contact us at:</p>
				<div class="contact-info">
					<p><strong>Email:</strong> <a href="mailto:contact@linguatech.app">contact@linguatech.app</a></p>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>
	</div>
</Layout>

<style>
	.terms-container {
		max-width: 800px;
		margin: 0 auto;
		padding: 2rem 1.5rem;
		background: white;
		border-radius: 12px;
		box-shadow: 0 4px 6px -1px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
		margin-top: 2rem;
		margin-bottom: 2rem;
	}

	.terms-content {
		text-align: left;
	}

	h1 {
		font-size: 2.5rem;
		font-weight: 700;
		color: #111827;
		margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
		text-align: center;
	}

	.last-updated {
		text-align: center;
		color: #6b7280;
		font-size: 0.9rem;
		margin-bottom: 2rem;
		font-style: italic;
	}

	.intro {
		background: #f8fafc;
		padding: 1.5rem;
		border-radius: 8px;
		border-left: 4px solid #3b82f6;
		margin-bottom: 2rem;
	}

	.intro p {
		margin: 0;
		font-size: 1rem;
		line-height: 1.6;
		color: #374151;
	}

	.terms-section {
		margin-bottom: 2rem;
	}

	.terms-section h2 {
		font-size: 1.25rem;
		font-weight: 600;
		color: #111827;
		margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
		border-bottom: 2px solid #e5e7eb;
		padding-bottom: 0.5rem;
	}

	.terms-section p {
		font-size: 1rem;
		line-height: 1.6;
		color: #374151;
		margin-bottom: 0;
	}

	.terms-section ul {
		margin: 0.5rem 0;
		padding-left: 1.5rem;
	}

	.terms-section li {
		font-size: 1rem;
		line-height: 1.6;
		color: #374151;
		margin-bottom: 0.25rem;
	}

	.terms-section strong {
		font-weight: 600;
		color: #111827;
	}

	.contact-section {
		margin-top: 3rem;
		padding-top: 2rem;
		border-top: 2px solid #e5e7eb;
	}

	.contact-section h2 {
		font-size: 1.25rem;
		font-weight: 600;
		color: #111827;
		margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
	}

	.contact-info {
		background: #f0f9ff;
		padding: 1rem;
		border-radius: 6px;
		margin-top: 0.5rem;
	}

	.contact-info p {
		margin: 0;
		text-align: center;
	}

	.contact-info strong {
		font-weight: 600;
		color: #111827;
	}

	a {
		color: #3b82f6;
		text-decoration: none;
	}

	a:hover {
		text-decoration: underline;
	}

	@media (max-width: 768px) {
		.terms-container {
			margin: 1rem;
			padding: 1.5rem 1rem;
		}

		h1 {
			font-size: 2rem;
		}

		.terms-section h2 {
			font-size: 1.1rem;
		}
	}
</style>
